{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["ACC-B1"],"summary":"The owner or controller of account ACC-B1 remains unknown. The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-B1 as active but leaves the owner and controller fields blank and contains no identity-verification record, customer identifier, or provider signature connecting the account to Bob Niran or another individual.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-memo-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/memo/paragraph-1"},{"source_id":"b-registry-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/account-registry/acc-b1"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Bob Niran","ACC-B1"],"summary":"The interview summary identifies Bob Niran as a person mentioned during the interview, but investigators state that the available information does not establish that he controls account ACC-B1; he is not identified as a verified account holder.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-interview-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/interview/bob/paragraph-2"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["ACC-B1","provider"],"summary":"Requested login, authentication, and session audit records were not supplied. The evidence-request note treats these records as missing from the case packet, does not state that no logins occurred, and indicates that the records should be requested from the provider.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-audit-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/evidence-request/login-audit"},{"source_id":"b-memo-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/memo/paragraph-1"}]}]}